    "notes": {
        "6c069694-7fea-4980-b59d-d9dc2c857cc4": {
            "theme": "purple",
            "content": "<p><strong>Unreal C++ quest sample<\/strong><\/p><p>Unreal starts at 01, then waits for world interactions. Picking up a cell updates powerCells through SetVariable. Using the generator executes 02 and reevaluates the branch every time.<\/p><p>Success carries the restore_power and open_gate components. The C++ command registry maps those custom IDs to world actions. They are authored metadata, not Arcscript functions.<\/p><p>In Arcweave Play Mode, edit powerCells in the Debugger to test both branches. In Unreal, collect cells in the world and use the generator again after an unsuccessful attempt.<\/p>"
        }
    },
    "elements": {
        "10be7825-974e-4306-b8e4-d2bbc63486dd": {
            "theme": "orange",
            "outputs": [],
            "components": [],
            "content": "<p>The generator needs two power cells. Search the outpost and collect the missing cells, then return here and try again.<\/p>",
            "title": "<p>02b \u00b7 More cells needed<\/p>"
        },
        "53a8e27d-542d-4222-85fc-36073d0e37df": {
            "theme": "gold",
            "outputs": [
                "d1857eb2-d333-4106-a851-f9f57f3c7a18"
            ],
            "components": [],
            "content": "<p>Checking the generator...<\/p><pre><code>show(\"Power cells collected: \", powerCells)<\/code><\/pre>",
            "title": "<p>02 \u00b7 Check the generator<\/p>"
        },
        "bfc100c0-7b99-4404-a71c-c1b42b102c02": {
            "theme": "green",
            "outputs": [],
            "components": [
                "defba3c3-cdce-4b80-91cc-b75118f1f512",
                "80c7c42c-bb19-4065-8afa-7cd5b54776fc"
            ],
            "content": "<pre><code>powerRestored = true<\/code><\/pre><p><strong>Power restored.<\/strong> The lights come on and the exit gate opens. Reach the illuminated exit to complete your escape.<\/p>",
            "title": "<p>03 \u00b7 Power restored<\/p>"
        },
        "e60800d3-a5aa-49c4-9b9c-fb5f8c1c09e7": {
            "theme": "cyan",
            "outputs": [
                "41afd57e-da4b-43f8-a668-e731ce7956f5"
            ],
            "components": [],
            "content": "<pre><code>questStarted = true<\/code><\/pre><p>The outpost is dark. Collect <strong>two power cells<\/strong>, then use the generator to restore the lights and open the exit gate.<\/p><p>You can try the generator before collecting both cells.<\/p>",
            "title": "<p>01 \u00b7 Restore power<\/p>"
        }
    },
